{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Elab.html#Lean.Elab.Html.elabHtmlCmd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabHtmlCmd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">Command.CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Elab.html#Lean.Elab.Html.elabHtmlCmd","kind":"def","line":140,"name":"Lean.Elab.Html.elabHtmlCmd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Html/Elab.lean#L140-L152"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/Elab.html#Lean.Elab.Html.htmlCmd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">htmlCmd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`#html e` evaluates the HTML value `e` and renders it in the infoview.\n`e` must have a type supported by some `#html` elaborator:\ncore Lean supports `Lean.Html`, whereas other packages may support custom HTML types.\n\nThis command behaves similarly to `#eval`;\n`e` may also be a computation in any monad supported by `#eval`, e.g. `IO Html`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/Elab.html#Lean.Elab.Html.htmlCmd","kind":"def","line":132,"name":"Lean.Elab.Html.htmlCmd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Html/Elab.lean#L132-L138"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class